## Geometry, depth, motion

- **Spacing** (`EquinoxDesign`): `spacingMicro` 2 · `spacingXS` 4 · `spacingSM` 8 · `spacingMD` 12 · `spacingLG` 16 · `spacingXL` 20. Panel padding 16.
- **Radii — continuous (squircle) corners.** `radiusSM` 8 · `cardRadius` 10 · `radiusLG` / `panelCornerRadius` 14 · `chipRadius` 4 · `cellRadius` 8.
- **Sizing is per S/M/L** — take it from `SizeMetrics`, never hard-code pixels: cell 30/36/40, panel & sheet width 340/380/420, toolbar button 28/30/32.
- **Materials.** Only the outer panel calls `.glassEffect(`, and it lives in `PanelComponents`. Transparency belongs to floating chrome — never to dense content. Solid fallback = opaque panel surface (`BackgroundStyle.solid`).
- **Cards = hairline border (6%) + low fill**, not a heavy shadow — `equinoxCard(_:)`.
- **Elevation** (`ShadowToken`): panel opacity .12 glass / .06 solid, radius 12, y 4 · sheet opacity .22, radius 20, y 12.
- **Motion — two springs.** `hoverAnimation` `.snappy(0.2)` (hover, selection); `expandAnimation` `.smooth(0.22)` (expand/disclose). `pressScale` 0.97. Always wrap in `EquinoxDesign.animation(_:reduceMotion:)` — a bare `.animation(EquinoxDesign.hoverAnimation` fails the compliance test.
- **States** (`StateOpacity`): `disabled` 0.5 · `declined` 0.65 · `weekendHighlight` 0.25 · `selectionTint` 0.16 · `selectionBorder` 0.35. Selected = accent tint + 55% ring.

**Signature element — the DayCell** (`UI/Main/DayCellView.swift`): today is a filled accent circle with a white SF-Rounded numeral; selection is an accent ring over a soft fill; events show as calendar-colored dots; month boundaries as thin `MonthBoundary` edges.

