## Components

Compose from these; don't re-implement them.

- **Core** (`EquinoxComponents.swift`) — `EquinoxButtonStyle` (`EquinoxButtonVariant` prominent / bordered / plain / destructive × `EquinoxButtonSize` regular / small), `equinoxCard(_:)` with `EquinoxCardStyle`, `EquinoxBadge`, `EquinoxChip` (calendar dot + label), `EquinoxBanner` (`EquinoxBannerStyle`), `EquinoxJoinButton`, `EventDetailCardBackground`.
- **Panel** (`PanelComponents.swift`) — `PanelButtonStyle`, `PanelIconButton`, `PanelIconMenuButton`, `PanelButtonGroup`, and the panel background/glass modifiers.
- **Settings** (`SettingsComponents.swift`) — `SettingsDetailScaffold`, `SettingsSection`, `SettingsRow`, `SettingsDivider`, `SettingsFooter`, `SettingsSegmentedPicker`, `SettingsSidebarLabel`, plus `SettingsLabeledToggle` from `AccessibilityHelpers.swift`.
- **Modals** (`ModalComponents.swift`) — `ModalSheetScaffold`, `ModalErrorBanner`, `ModalConfirmDialog`.
- **Calendar & events** — `EventStripeView`, `DayEventColors`, `SelectableCalendarColors`, `ParticipationChipStyle`.

One prominent button per view.

---

## Do / Don't

**Do:** one accent; adaptive system surfaces; continuous corners; hairline-on-low-fill cards; SF type with rounded numerals + mono times; sizes from `SizeMetrics`; Title-Case terse copy; motion gated on reduce-motion; light/dark/system via `ThemePreference`.

**Don't:** add a second brand color; hard-code pixels, hex, opacities, or font sizes in feature views; use gradients on content (only the join button); use emoji; use heavy drop shadows; use non-system fonts; call `.glassEffect(` outside `PanelComponents`; touch `EKEventStore` from a view; write chatty marketing copy.
